From d8e8a0f1cccc1acdb95e634c4754c4aad519a708 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gtex-port <igomezv0921@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 18:50:56 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] misc: add SC2331 FDL1 loader over UART0 (v49 Wi-Fi phase
 2)

Enable SC7730 UART0 and serdev, upload the Marlin FDL1 with the BSL BootROM protocol, then let SDIO1 enumerate only after the FDL starts. The load address is inferred from absolute pointers in sc2331_fdl.bin.

Development candidate only: not built and not tested on hardware.
